{
  "id": "Lyo.Reporting.Web.Components",
  "name": "Lyo.Reporting.Web.Components",
  "area": "Integration",
  "tagline": "MudBlazor ops UI for Lyo Reporting: browse definitions, run reports, and view/download generations.",
  "description": "MudBlazor ops UI for Lyo Reporting: browse definitions, run reports, and view/download generations.\n\nThis package is a **Razor component library** — no `AddXxx` DI. The host supplies an authenticated `IApiClient` (and optional FileStorage download/view callbacks).\n\nPair with [`Lyo.Api.Reporting`](../../Api/Lyo.Api.Reporting/README.md) on the API host and [`Lyo.Reporting.Client`](../Lyo.Reporting.Client/README.md) for typed HTTP access.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Host page",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Notes"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`BaseRoute`",
          "Reporting route prefix (default `\"Reporting\"`)."
        ],
        [
          "`DownloadFileAsync`",
          "Host callback for blob download by `OutputFileId`."
        ],
        [
          "`ViewFileUrlAsync`",
          "Host callback returning a browser URL for HTML/PDF preview."
        ]
      ],
      "lead": "```razor\n@using Lyo.Reporting.Web.Components\n\n<ReportManagement BaseRoute=\"Reporting\"\n                  DownloadFileAsync=\"DownloadReportFileAsync\"\n                  ViewFileUrlAsync=\"GetReportViewUrlAsync\" />\n\n@code {\n    // Wire to your FileStorage (or Gateway) download/view endpoints.\n    private Task DownloadReportFileAsync(Guid fileId, CancellationToken ct)\n        => /* stream via IJsInterop.DownloadFileFromStream */ Task.CompletedTask;\n\n    private Task<string?> GetReportViewUrlAsync(Guid fileId, CancellationToken ct)\n        => Task.FromResult<string?>($\"/files/{fileId}\");\n}\n```",
      "trail": "When download/view callbacks are omitted, those menu actions show a snackbar that the host has not configured them. Generations without `OutputFileId` (persist hook skipped) only\nsupport the Details dialog."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Components",
      "headers": [
        "Component",
        "Role"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`ReportManagement`",
          "Tabs: Definitions / Generations"
        ],
        [
          "`ReportDefinitionGrid`",
          "Definition list + Run"
        ],
        [
          "`ReportDefinitionView`",
          "Definition detail / JSON preview"
        ],
        [
          "`RunReportDialog`",
          "Parameters + format override → `POST …/Generation/Generate`; Options / AllowedValues render as MudSelect with live sibling binding"
        ],
        [
          "`ReportGenerationGrid`",
          "Generation list + View/Download"
        ],
        [
          "`ReportGenerationView`",
          "Generation detail + View/Download actions"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
